# Run scratch (regenerated by the sbatch jobs) — keep the directories, ignore contents.
# The per-run *_metrics.json files ARE committed: they are the raw records behind every
# ladder / leave-one-out / scale number in the paper (their multi-hundred-thousand-sample
# profiler timelines are stripped where no figure plots them; see the repository README).
results/logs/*
!results/logs/.gitkeep
**/_work/
**/stores/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
